errat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t>Progression &amp; Continuous Improvement</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="595959"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:ea typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:cs typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/><a:sym typeface="Montserrat Alternates"/></a:rPr><a:t> through leveling and gamified goal achievement which help instill a growth oriented mindset. Includes added visual aids to reinforce the concepts and demonstrate progress over time.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:notes>